# Butler Routes - Silverpine Forest rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 7 rank-flagged rares of Silverpine Forest
# (zone key 1421), verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever npc/object/item dumps). Every goal is optional - a
# missing spawn never wedges the guide. All 7 rares hold single points,
# so every rare step is a plain single-goto step; no rare loops. The three
# in-band rares (Gorefang, Old Vicejaw, Krethis Shadowspinner) drop
# signature recipes that ride as optional collects with notes; the four
# above-band rares (levels 21-23, band top 20) ship with honest
# come-back-later notes. Varimathras (rank 3, no rare role) stays out:
# a core-contracted quest NPC, not a rare. No tame lines: the NPC records
# carry no family flag (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Treasures ride
# loop steps over their fixed data points (two Battered Chest objects get
# one loop each), single-point objects get their own steps.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silverpine-rares
title Silverpine Forest - Rares & Treasures
levels 10-20
zone Silverpine Forest
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords silverpine forest, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step North shore - Gorefang

  zone map 1421

  goto 59.53,7.64
  kill 12431 optional
  collect 2555 "Recipe: Swiftness Potion" optional
  note Gorefang (level 13 rare) holds a single north-shore point. The Swiftness Potion recipe is its signature loot in the data (a world-drop table elsewhere - the recipes companion does not list it as zone content).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West woods - Krethis Shadowspinner

  zone map 1421

  goto 35.7,8.25
  kill 12433 optional
  collect 2407 "Pattern: White Leather Jerkin" optional
  note Krethis Shadowspinner (level 15 rare) holds a single west-woods point. The White Leather Jerkin pattern is its signature loot in the data (a world-drop table elsewhere - the recipes companion does not list it as zone content).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Central woods - Old Vicejaw

  zone map 1421

  goto 53.85,51.93
  kill 12432 optional
  collect 2406 "Pattern: Fine Leather Boots" optional
  collect 2881 "Plans: Runed Copper Breastplate" optional
  note Old Vicejaw (level 14 rare) holds a single central-woods point. The Fine Leather Boots pattern and the Runed Copper Breastplate plans are its signature loot in the data (world-drop tables elsewhere - the recipes companion does not list them as zone content).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Beren's Peril - Ravenclaw Regent

  zone map 1421

  goto 56.83,70.18
  kill 2283 optional
  note Ravenclaw Regent (level 22 rare) holds a single Beren's Peril point. Above the core band - come back at 22. No signature loot in the data - shared world drops only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ambermill - Dalaran Spellscribe

  zone map 1421

  goto 63.54,63.35
  kill 1920 optional
  note Dalaran Spellscribe (level 21 Alliance rare) holds a single Ambermill point (it also spawns in Hillsbrad - only the Silverpine point is routed). Above the core band - come back at 21. No signature loot in the data - shared world drops only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

